      "id": "claim_da15c42bfc0d4f01af5188f1d9074544",
      "statement": "authz.rs's Session (in-memory, never persisted) carries the allowlists the whole trust model hangs on: project_dir (set by project:setDir, cleared of allowed_escapes when it changes), allowed_escapes (pdf:allowPath approvals), known_projects (save refuses anything else), readable_pdfs (pdf_read refuses anything else), writable_exports (text_write and pdf_embed_marks' newPath target refuse anything else), stamps (mtime_nanos:len per file for stale-write detection via changed(): Some→None is not changed, None→Some is), known_git_roots (assert_root re-checks every mutating git command), and listed_splits.",
