      "statement": "Every renderer-named write path is validated with within() (component-wise containment on normalized absolute paths) applied both after lexical resolution and again after canonicalize(), plus assert_not_symlink() (symlink_metadata refuses writing through a link; a missing file is fine); paths.rs implements Node's path.resolve/relative semantics so renderer path strings behave as the old TypeScript checks expected.",
