    {
      "id": "claim_21d38952f5504355afb68ecd3a7829df",
      "statement": "The slr-file scheme (slr-file://project/pdf?path=<rel>, built by DesktopAdapter) serves PDFs from the open project's directory with the path carried as a query parameter (Chromium collapses '..' in URL paths but not query values); protocol.rs answers OPTIONS with CORS headers advertising Range, returns 403 Forbidden for paths escaping project_dir without an allowed escape, 404 for no-project/missing, re-checks containment after canonicalize(), and serves single byte ranges (206 + Content-Range, 416 with bytes */len, full 200 otherwise, HEAD supported) so pdf.js can stream.",
