      "id": "claim_9c05a5659c5349c1be9c2da66650a9c7",
      "statement": "LLM API keys never reach the renderer: llm_save_config stores a non-empty key in the OS keychain (keyring crate, service 'SaiLoR', account 'llm:<id>') and writes only a 'keyring': true marker into llm-config.json (Electron-era format, raw JSON entries, mode 0600 on Unix); llm_configs and save/delete return public_configs stripping key/marker and exposing only hasKey, so there is no read-back and an edit with a blank key field keeps the stored key; at call time build_call_headers substitutes the {{apiKey}} sentinel into headers, dropping sentinel headers for noKey targets.",
