      "statement": "net.rs provides the shared rustls/ring HTTP plumbing: a builder with no cookies or decompression, the NO_REDIRECT client with redirect::Policy::none() used by the LLM, Ollama and local-server calls, and the Flight abort registry — Flight::new(id) registers a Notify, run() races the future against abort(id) and a timeout, Drop removes the entry, and the abort commands (llm_abort with llm:<id>, web_abort with the bare requestId, ollama_cancel_pull with pull:<id>, local_cancel with local:<id> or 'runtime') all funnel through net::abort.",
