      "id": "claim_24ecb5a88a0141df8df6ae941ca2074c",
      "statement": "update.rs implements the user-triggered self-update on tauri-plugin-updater with the feed endpoint (https://github.com/Gram21/SaiLoR/releases/latest/download/latest.json), pubkey and requireSignedVersion: true fixed in tauri.conf.json and never renderer-controllable; update_check reports { supported: false, manual: true } unless the bundle is AppImage, NSIS, MSI or the macOS App (deb/rpm and unbundled builds update manually), stores a pending Update and emits update:available; update_download emits capped integer percents via update:progress and stores bytes; update_install refuses while the project is dirty ('Save your project before you install the update.'), installs the stored bytes and restarts; errors surface as update:error events.",
