    {
      "id": "claim_3f37be8e173647f1b77980e90a5af434",
      "statement": "shell.rs builds the main window from tauri.conf.json (create: false) with navigation guards: is_app_url admits only tauri://localhost, about:blank, http(s)://tauri.localhost and the debug dev origin; anything else is denied in-window and http/https links are handed to the OS opener, and on_new_window always denies; it also migrates legacy Electron userData (SLR Helper/slr-helper → SaiLoR, copying window-state.json and Local Storage once, skipping symlinks, never overwriting) and on macOS swaps the Edit menu's native Undo/Redo for app:undo/app:redo items.",
